-----------------------
Ghostty vendors these Zig libraries; rustty ports the subset it uses into pure-Rust
crates. Each is credited under its upstream license:

  libvaxis  — TUI library — Tim Culverhouse (rockorager) — MIT
              → rustty-vaxis
  zf        — fuzzy finder — Nathan Craddock — MIT
              → rustty-zf
  uucode    — Unicode data (0.1.0) — Jacob Sandlund — MIT
              → rustty-vaxis/src/uucode (+ vendored UCD 16.0.0, see below)
  z2d       — 2D vector graphics — upstream https://github.com/vancluever/z2d
              (no license file was present in the pinned tarball; confirm the
              upstream license before any public release)
              → rustty-z2d
  libxev    — event loop — Mitchell Hashimoto — MIT
              → rustty-xev


